# Packages every profile gets. A profile can leave one out with "-name".
#
# Firmware updates from this repository's GitHub releases (feeds/ra81/):
# System -> Firmware Update in LuCI, or "ra81-ota" on the command line.
# To build without them, put these two lines in your profile:
#   -luci-app-ra81-ota
#   -ra81-ota
ra81-ota
luci-app-ra81-ota
